  <name>iXress - Prepress Suite</name>
  <summary>Pre-Press &amp; Print-Production Software Solutions</summary>
  
  <description>
    <p>
      iXress Prepress Software Suite provides professional layout automation,
      imposition, and pre-press tools for the printing industry.
      It is designed to streamline workflows for prepress professionals,
      print shops, and designers.
    </p>
    <p>
      Features:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Automated layout creation and template management.</li>
      <li>Imposition tools for various fold patterns and sheet sizes.</li>
      <li>PDF page geometry boxes manipulation (TrimBox, BleedBox, etc.).</li>
      <li>Color management and ICC profile integrations.</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

